    "title": "Lansing Restaurant Week is May 9 - 17 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Randy Stine ,\n13 hours ago LANSING, MI — Who is ready to munch? A week-long celebration that will leave your taste buds in awe of the culinary magic that exists in Lansing begins next week. Lansing 5:01, Lansing Foodies, and Choose Lansing have partnered together to present the 3rd annual Lansing Restaurant Week May 9 – 17 — an annual event where foodies unite for the ultimate self-guided tour of the region’s dining scene. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
